 Cleanup;c;q;r
⍝ Shuts the test server down and tries to unload Conga
 c←∆NewClient
 q←Rumba.NewRequest 0
 q.RequestTarget←'/Shutdown'
 r←c Rumba.SendAndReceive q
 RemoveTestFolder ⍬
 1 ⎕NDELETE'Plodder_Testserver.dws'
 :If 0<##.RumbaLean.⎕NC'Conga'
 :AndIf 0<##.RumbaLean.Conga.⎕NC'⍙naedfns'
     :Trap 11
         ##.RumbaLean.Conga.UnloadSharedLib
     :EndTrap
 :EndIf
⍝Done
